    title="Days, months, seasons and the clock"
    summary="talk about time"
    doc="Days of the week, months, seasons, how long things are (days in a week, minutes in an hour) and the 12-hour clock. The knowledge base holds the calendar facts; today and the time of day can be told in the dialog; what time is it uses the real clock when nothing was told. Hand-built platform fixture and demo, not produced by the C1 workflow."
